Build-Depends: dpkg-dev, build-essential:native
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: scriptsuite
Architecture: amd64
Depends: policykit-1
Description: Desktop maintenance tasks with systemd scheduling
 ScriptSuite runs small, auditable Bash maintenance scripts (temp cleanup,
 downloads/screenshots tidying, trash emptying, journal vacuum, software
 inventory, system health reports) from an Avalonia dashboard on KDE Neon.
 Per-script systemd user timers provide unattended runs; admin tasks
 elevate via polkit (pkexec) for interactive runs only.
